# Patterns to ignore when building packages (helm package / helm
# dependency update). Unlike .gitignore, this controls what gets bundled
# into the .tgz a downstream library (e.g. mdeploy) pulls in via file:// — so
# it matters for more than repo hygiene: without excluding tests/ here,
# every downstream `helm dependency update` repackages crdkit's ENTIRE
# directory tree, including tests/stub's own charts/crdkit-*.tgz (its
# bundled copy of crdkit, from testing locally) — which itself may
# contain a stale, even-earlier-nested copy, growing with every local
# test cycle. This exact recursive bloat once pushed a packaged crdkit
# past 5MB and broke helm-unittest's file-size limit in a downstream test
# chart. tests/ and scripts/ are crdkit's own local dev/test scaffolding
# — a downstream consumer never needs them.
tests/
scripts/
# helm-unittest output; a pattern without "/" matches at any depth (Helm
# rejects "**").
__snapshot__/

# Common VCS dirs
.git/
.gitignore
.helmignore

# Common backup files
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig

# Various IDEs
.project
.idea/
*.tmproj
.vscode/
.DS_Store
